# Gist API Endpoints

## Endpoints Covered
- `GET /gists/public` — List public gists
- `GET /gists/{gist_id}` — Get single gist

## Test Data
- Uses dynamically fetched gist IDs from the public listing.
- Constants in `data/gists_constants.py`
